    <h1><mark>Brownies 😋</mark></h1>
    <p>Brownies are chocolates made from dough and baked.<br>They are made of soft, moist, and chewy dough.<br>Brownies are common in the United States but have gained popularity across other countries.<br>Brownies may come in square and rectangular shapes.<br>They may be fudgy or cakey based on their ingredients.</p>
