    <br><p>A rose is a beautiful flowering plant belonging to the genus Rosa, known for its fragrance and soft petals. <br>It is one of the most popular flowers in the world and comes in many colors like red, white, pink, and yellow.<br> Each color of a rose represents different emotions such as love, peace, and friendship. <br>Roses are widely used for decoration, making perfumes, and in food products like rose water.<br> The plant has stems with thorns, green leaves, and attractive flowers.<br> Roses are often considered a symbol of love and beauty. 🌹</p>
